{"action_id": "CONTACT-000095", "alternatives_considered": "", "basis_id": "BASIS-000007", "confidence": 0.7, "construal": "顧客（CUS-R28、案件APP-R28、銀行口座）から、本人確認書類を揃え申込書を提出する意向の連絡。利用開始日4月23日指定。DFH-SAL-024に基づき顧客接触記録を残す。", "decision": "record_customer_contactで顧客接触を記録し、申込管理部（伊藤）への連絡を行う。", "evidence_plan": "顧客接触記録（CRM）に残す。申込管理部への連絡履歴も残す。", "felt_constraints": "", "g1_citation_handle_exists": true, "g1_span_exists": true, "g2_prior_read": true, "g3_entailment": "supported", "g3_machine_heuristic": "supported", "grounded": true, "retrieved": [{"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-024:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-024", "version": "1.1"}, {"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-031:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-031", "version": "1.1"}], "run_id": "root-d0b01", "seat_id": "emp-G", "tick": 33, "trigger_event": "record_customer_contact", "ts": "2026-07-29T05:36:10.940474+00:00"}
